        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-05-10T04:21:35.173Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I counted myself lucky each turn that went by without one. I was able to use one Gazelle card (in Croc form) to stack the deck, force a shuffle, and avoid the cloaking device ever coming out. I did wipe out the Reactive Platings first, otherwise I never would’ve just barely survived. And an Entry Point coupled with Charged Attacks would’ve definitely been the end of me!</p>",
