        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-05-10T13:33:47.686Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Knocked down the Reactive Plating, then the other Reactive Plating, then the Personal Cloaking Device… Winced as Frost’s Cryo Chamber set off both Sonic Mines, then laughed as their effects immediately wore off on Ambuscade’s turn…</p>\n<p>Then a Haka Of Battle charged up a 16-point Taiaha, and Expatriette Unloaded for another 14, and poor Ansel started to reconsider his life choices.</p>",
