        "created_at": "2022-05-10T14:48:54.721Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Count me in the “yes, it was a Mint, but <em>ouch</em>” category of player. Like Thunderbird, I ended with all three heroes alive but in single digits, and like Thunderbird it was because I foolishly allowed a Charged Attacks-reaction to take 8-12 health off each hero.</p>\n<p>Still, a mint’s a mint!</p>",
