      {
        "id": 245030,
        "name": "Hankroyd",
        "username": "Hankroyd",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-05-11T11:41:10.736Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don’t usually do one-shot, but this one seemed so easy I was curious to see what the catch was.<br>\nAnd the catch was it had no catch.<br>\nI didn’t to outthink the decks and played as I would have played a normal game.<br>\nI managed to sort the decks to avoid the cold chamber, Haka ate the cloaking device and a bunch of weapons, mines were taken when Naturalist can protect the others.<br>\nNo charged attack, no flamethrower … everyone ended at 25+ life.</p>\n<p>A nice little relaxing game. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-05-11T11:41:10.736Z",
